# Dashboard -> orchestrator task command.
#
# task is one of:
#   home, retract, pick_place, pick_to, pick_selected, tidy,
#   open_gripper, close_gripper, stop, estop, reset
#
# x/y      place target in base_link metres; read by pick_to only.
# ids      perception ids to act on; read by pick_selected only. Empty means
#          "every cube", which is what tidy does.
#
# stop vs estop: stop ends the cycle tidily (reopen the gripper, return HOME).
# estop halts the arm where it stands and latches - nothing but reset is
# accepted afterwards.
string task
float64 x
float64 y
int32[] ids
---
bool accepted
string message
